  "releaseNotes": "Servicebase & SessionService:\n      - ServiceBase Introduction: New event-driven foundation to run alongside ManagerBase.\n      - Task Classification: Static/Predictable tasks now use ServiceBase (Resource-saving), while Dynamic/Complex tasks remain on ManagerBase (Dedicated threads).\n      - SessionService: Replaces LuciferGuard, utilizing ServiceBase for optimized background maintenance.\n      - Physical Binding: Anchors Identity directly to Socket ID, neutralizing token-replay attacks.\n      - Hybrid Memory: Pooled SessionEntry (Performance) and GC-managed UserEntry (Identity Integrity).",
